ed anytime on WhatsApp."},{"q":"What is the cancellation policy?","a":"Non-refundable after issue; date-change requests subject to park policy up to 48h prior."}]', 0, 0, 5, 1, 'Ferrari World Abu Dhabi | Book Online & WhatsApp — Anchor Point UAE', 'Theme park entry, with fast-track option. Duration: Full day. From AED 345 per person. Instant confirmation on WhatsApp.', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', 'Theme park, instant ticket', 0, 265.0, 'Adults 1.3m+ height | Junior under 1.3m | Under 3 yrs free', '{"attraction_type":"Theme park","overview":"Experience the world\'s fastest roller coaster—Formula Rossa (240 km/h)—alongside Flying Aces, Ferrari racing simulators, and family adventure zones inside Yas Island\'s climate-controlled dome.","opening_hours":"Daily 11:00 AM – 08:00 PM (Last entry 07:00 PM).","ticket_types":[{"name":"Single-Day General Admission","adult":"AED 345","child":"AED 265"},{"name":"Admission + Quick Pass (Fast-Track)","adult":"AED 540","child":"AED 460"},{"name":"2-Park Yas Island Combo (Add Warner Bros. or Yas Waterworld)","adult":"AED 475","child":"AED 475"}],"date_time_note":"Select your visit date in the form; ask on WhatsApp for 2-Park combos or private Dubai hotel transfer.","delivery_method":"Official PDF barcode ticket delivered via WhatsApp & Email.","terms_rules":"Non-refundable after issue; date-change requests subject to park policy up to 48h prior.","reviews":[{"author":"Vikram D. (India)","rating":5,"comment":"Formula Rossa and Flying Aces are world-class! Booked the 2-park Yas combo on WhatsApp and saved big."}]}');
