 the cancellation policy?","a":"Valid on selected date; non-refundable after ticket generation."}]', 0, 0, 7, 1, 'IMG Worlds of Adventure | Book Online & WhatsApp — Anchor Point UAE', 'Indoor theme park entry. Duration: Full day. From AED 325 per person. Instant confirmation on WhatsApp.', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', 'Theme park, skip-the-line ticket', 0, 325.0, 'Standard ticket over 1.05m height | Children under 1.05m enter free', '{"attraction_type":"Theme park","overview":"Dubai\'s mega indoor theme park brings Marvel superheroes, Cartoon Network favourites, life-sized animatronic dinosaurs, and the high-speed Velociraptor roller coaster together under one climate-controlled roof.","opening_hours":"Sun–Thu 12:00 PM – 10:00 PM | Fri–Sat 12:00 PM – 11:00 PM (Last entry 1 hour before close).","ticket_types":[{"name":"General Admission (All Rides)","adult":"AED 325","child":"AED 325"},{"name":"Admission + Fast Track Pass","adult":"AED 520","child":"AED 520"}],"date_time_note":"Choose your visit date in the form; we can also bundle private return hotel transfers on WhatsApp.","delivery_method":"Instant PDF barcode ticket via WhatsApp & Email.","terms_rules":"Valid on selected date; non-refundable after ticket generation.","reviews":[{"author":"Noor H. (Qatar)","rating":5,"comment":"Velociraptor and Spider-Man rides were awesome—no waiting at the ticket booth with our QR passes."}]}');
