te hotel transfers can be added anytime on WhatsApp."},{"q":"What is the cancellation policy?","a":"Valid for selected date; non-refundable once issued."}]', 0, 0, 9, 1, 'Louvre Abu Dhabi | Book Online & WhatsApp — Anchor Point UAE', 'Museum entry tickets. Duration: 2 to 3 hours. From AED 65 per person. Instant confirmation on WhatsApp.', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', '2026-11-02 09:52:01', 'Museum, skip-the-line ticket', 0, 0.0, 'Adults 18+ yrs: AED 65 | Under 18 yrs enter FREE (free child ticket still required)', '{"attraction_type":"Museum","overview":"Explore masterpieces spanning human civilization beneath Jean Nouvel\'s floating geometric dome on Saadiyat Island, where sunlight filters down like rain over tranquil seawater plazas.","opening_hours":"Tue–Thu 10:00 AM – 06:30 PM | Fri–Sun 10:00 AM – 08:30 PM (Closed Mondays; last entry 1 hr before close).","ticket_types":[{"name":"Adult Admission (18+ yrs)","adult":"AED 65","child":"FREE"},{"name":"Louvre Ticket + Private Return Transfer from Dubai","adult":"AED 295","child":"AED 190"}],"date_time_note":"Note: Louvre Abu Dhabi is closed on Mondays. Choose Tue–Sun in the form below.","delivery_method":"Official PDF QR ticket delivered via WhatsApp & Email.","terms_rules":"Valid for selected date; non-refundable once issued.","reviews":[{"author":"Isabelle R. (France)","rating":5,"comment":"Breathtaking architecture and serene galleries—skip-the-line QR code worked instantly."}]}');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `slug`, `badge`, `short_desc`, `long_desc`, `duration`, `price_aed`, `original_price_aed`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `featured_image`, `gallery_json`, `itinerary_json`, `inclusions_json`, `exclusions_json`, `pickup_details`, `availability`, `faq_json`, `is_featured`, `is_combo`, `sort_order`, `is_active`, `seo_title`, `seo_desc`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `pickup_line`, `has_pickup`, `child_price_aed`, `age_policy`, `details_json`) VALUES (2718, 5, 'The View at The Palm', 'the-view-at-the-palm', 'Observation Deck', 'Level 52 observation deck over Palm Jumeirah', 'Rise to the 52nd floor of Palm Tower for sweeping 360° views of Palm Jumeirah, the Arabian Gulf and the Dubai skyline from an indoor lounge and open-air terrace.', '1 to 1.5 hours', 119.0, NULL, 4.8, 98, '/uploads/attractions/the-view-at-the-palm.jpg', '["/uploads/attractions/the-view-at-the-palm.jpg"]', '[]', '["Timed-entry e-ticket to The View at The Palm","Indoor viewing gallery and outdoor terrace","Interactive Palm Jumeirah displays"]', '["Hotel transfers (available on request)","Food, drinks and personal expenses"]', 'Daily, typically 9:00 AM – 10:00 PM (last entry about 1 hour before closing).', 'Daily', '[{"q":"How do I book The View at The Palm?","a":"Tap \\"Book on WhatsApp\\" or send the enquiry form on this page. Our UAE team confirms availability and sends your e-ticket quickly on WhatsApp (+971 52 537 6838)."},{"q":"Is hotel transfer available?","a":"Yes. Private hotel transfers can be added to any attraction ticket on request. Message us on WhatsApp for pricing."},{"q":"Can I change the date after booking?","a":"Date changes depend on the venue policy. Contact us at least 24 hours before your visit and we will help wherever possible."}]', 0, 0, 10, 1, 'The View at The Palm Tickets Dubai & UAE | Book Online — Anchor Point', 'Level 52 observation deck over Palm Jumeirah. From AED 119 per person. Instant e-ticket confirmation on WhatsApp.', '2026-11-02 15:38:16', '2026-11-02 15:38:16', 'Venue entry, e-ticket', 0, 99.0, 'Adults | Children: see ticket rates | Infants usually free', '{"attraction_type":"Observation Deck","ticket_group":"landmarks","overview":"Rise to the 52nd floor of Palm Tower for sweeping 360° views of Palm Jumeirah, the Arabian Gulf and the Dubai skyline from an indoor lounge and open-air terrace.","opening_hours":"Daily, typically 9:00 AM – 10:00 PM (last entry about 1 hour before closing).","ticket_types":[{"name":"Standard Admission","adult":"AED 119","child":"AED 99"}],"date_time_note":"Choose your preferred date in the booking form. Time slots are confirmed on WhatsApp.","delivery_method":"Official e-ticket (QR code) delivered via WhatsApp and Email after confirmation.","important_notes":"Sunset slots sell out early, so book ahead for the best light.","terms_rules":"Indicative \\"from\\" prices; the final rate is confirmed on WhatsApp before payment. Tickets are date-specific, and date changes or refunds follow the venue policy.","package_discounts":"Ask on WhatsApp for combo tickets, group pricing and private hotel transfers."}');
