 399 per person. Instant e-ticket confirmation on WhatsApp.', '2026-11-02 15:38:16', '2026-11-02 15:38:16', 'Venue entry, e-ticket', 0, 365.0, 'Adults | Children: see ticket rates | Infants usually free', '{"attraction_type":"Multi-Park Pass","ticket_group":"combo-passes","overview":"Choose a multi-park pass to visit Motiongate Dubai, Bollywood Parks Dubai and LEGOLAND Dubai across several days at a lower per-park price.","opening_hours":"Pass validity and park hours vary; confirmed on WhatsApp.","ticket_types":[{"name":"Standard Admission","adult":"AED 399","child":"AED 365"}],"date_time_note":"Choose your preferred date in the booking form. Time slots are confirmed on WhatsApp.","delivery_method":"Official e-ticket (QR code) delivered via WhatsApp and Email after confirmation.","important_notes":"Pass options (2 or 3 parks) vary; ask on WhatsApp for the best combination.","terms_rules":"Indicative \\"from\\" prices; the final rate is confirmed on WhatsApp before payment. Tickets are date-specific, and date changes or refunds follow the venue policy.","package_discounts":"Ask on WhatsApp for combo tickets, group pricing and private hotel transfers."}');

